  "releaseNotes": "'## [13.3.4](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v13.3.3...v13.3.4) (2026-10-20)\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* correct Nullable<T> detection in transpiler and CLI output deadlock in Aspire hosting ([#1286](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1286)) ([a55758d](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/a55758d3cd0c2f517d8f1f52f1cce8f24f31699d)), closes [#1285](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1285)\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* **core:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1281](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1281)) ([8745afc](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8745afca81389438cf3393101650766f0c772085))\n* **core:** update opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib monorepo to 1.20.0 ([#1283](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1283)) ([05f371c](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/05f371c923d1571279b00216f57f6ecfa24153c5))\n* **docs:** update react monorepo to v19.3.1 ([#1280](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1280)) ([c1bed81](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/c1bed81cfd9abcee379c13f961fe39371405b4d8))\n* **test:** update dependency kubernetesclient to v21 ([#1279](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1279)) ([9e409b7](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/9e409b749336903b2890f1319bde7e863762db9c))\n* **test:** update dependency microsoft.net.test.sdk to 18.11.0 ([#1278](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1278)) ([8bc4f1b](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/8bc4f1b42b886738fb704978f1cf212f66ed8f68))\n* **test:** update dotnet monorepo ([#1277](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1277)) ([960656a](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/960656a9c2ba575c21852a7a529735a9bd455a5e))\n* **test:** update opentelemetry-dotnet monorepo ([#1284](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1284)) ([a2bfb66](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/a2bfb66709cb065a2d3338664c34f7758be0d995))\n'",
